OL,3,GNEWSAFuel leak spreads more than two
OL,4,Amiles along River Taff
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been advised to keep their
OL,7,Fwindows and doors shut due to a
OL,8,Fwidespread fuel leak in the River Taff.
OL,10,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) said it
OL,11,Fhad received multiple reports about
OL,12,Fpollution affecting the Taff in places
OL,13,Fsuch as Nantgarw, Treforest and Taffs
OL,14,FWell.
OL,16,FGE Aerospace confirmed fuel got into
OL,17,Fthe river while repair work took place
OL,18,Fat its site nearby.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
