OL,3,GNEWSAFuel leak spreads more than two
OL,4,Amiles along River Taff
OL,5,
OL,6,FNRW said the source was identified at
OL,7,F19:30 BST on Friday, and its officers
OL,8,Fare working to identify how it entered
OL,9,Fthe drainage system, after kerosene
OL,10,Fspread down almost 2.5 miles (4km) of
OL,11,Fthe river.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
